@base = http://localhost:8002
@token = paste-access-token
@serviceId = paste-service-id
@bookingId = paste-booking-id
# Set a future date and timestamp matching the weekday/window below.
@day = 2026-11-02
@start = 2026-11-02T09:00:00-05:00

### Register a provider (register a second account to act as customer)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"provider@example.com","password":"Change-this-example-password-123"}

### Login. Copy access_token to @token.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=provider%40example.com&password=Change-this-example-password-123

### Create service. Copy id to @serviceId.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Backend consultation","timezone":"America/Bogota","duration_minutes":60}

### Add Monday window (Monday=0)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/services/{{serviceId}}/windows
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"weekday":0,"starts_at":"09:00","ends_at":"17:00"}

### Check availability (UTC response)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/services/{{serviceId}}/availability?day={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book. Copy id to @bookingId. Repeating this request returns 409.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"service_id":"{{serviceId}}","starts_at":"{{start}}"}

### My reservations
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (customer or service owner)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search the service catalog
GET {{base}}/api/v1/services?search=backend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter confirmed reservations
GET {{base}}/api/v1/bookings?status=confirmed&starts_from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&starts_before=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reschedule an existing future, confirmed reservation (run before cancelling)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"starts_at":"2026-11-02T10:00:00-05:00"}

### Availability across multiple days; update both dates to a future range
GET {{base}}/api/v1/services/{{serviceId}}/availability-range?day_from=2026-11-02&day_to=2026-11-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
